8,6769,6769.T,ザイン,9,ok,EQUITY,"THine Electronics, Inc.",Technology,Semiconductors,https://www.thine.co.jp,"THine Electronics, Inc., a fabless semiconductor company, engages in the planning, designing, and sale of mixed-signal large scale integrations (LSIs) in Japan and internationally. It operates through LSI Business and AIOT Business segments. The company offers V-by-One HS that supports the higher resolutions required by flat panel displays; V-by-One for solving skew problems, EMI emission, and space of printed circuit boards of a system; low-voltage differential signaling (LVDS) products; V-by-One HS plus, an advanced high-speed serial interface standard for higher resolution comprising 4K/8K and higher refresh rate over 120Hz on high-speed video inter connect; IOHA:B transceivers; and USB products. It also provides power modules, RGB and backlight LED drivers, image signal processors and camera development kits, video ADCs, camera systems and video extension solutions, and fever detection and facial recognition systems. The company's products are used in CameraLink and USB/UVC cameras; video teleconference system, such as digital signages 4K sports/action cameras; security and body cameras; video conference systems and printers; gaming monitors and machines; smart city/commerce applications; medical monitors and endoscopes; and drive recorders and electron mirrors applications. THine Electronics, Inc. was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan.",11904143360,JPY,,ok,https://www.thine.co.jp | https://www.thine.co.jp/corporate/outline/ | https://www.thine.co.jp/news_detail/id=5082,"THine Electronics - Interface to the Future - THine 製品紹介 アプリケーション サポート THine Value 資料ダウンロード 企業情報 育英財団 日本語 JP English 한국어 简体中文 繁體中文 カスタム ICの ご案内 お問合せ Keyword Search インタフェース Optical Network 電源 LEDドライバ Camera Processor Others Kit Solutions AI&IoT Solution インタフェース V-by-One® HS V-by-One® LVDS V-by-One® HS plus IOHA:B USB Optical Network PCIe (VCSEL Driver/TIA) UCIe (VCSEL Dr