8,6794,6794.T,6794.T,2,ok,EQUITY,"Foster Electric Company, Limited",Technology,Consumer Electronics,https://www.foster-electric.com,"Foster Electric Company, Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells loudspeakers, audio equipment, and electronical equipment in Japan, China, the United States, rest of Asia, Europe, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Speaker, Mobile Audio, and Other. The company offers various speaker products, including automotive, USB, general, flat-screen TVs, and 2 in 1 vibration, as well as speaker systems. It also provides mobile audio products, such as mobile phone headsets, headphones, earphones, Bluetooth headsets, and earphone drivers, as well as vibration actuators. In addition, the company offers automotive components and products comprising alarm, eCall, audio, and acoustic vehicle alerting system speakers, as well as actuators, headphones, and alarm buzzers; small acoustic components, such as magnetics buzzers and sounders for alarm sounds; products under the Fostex brand; and logistics services. Foster Electric Company, Limited was incorporated in 1948 and is headquartered in Akishima, Japan.",67965120512,JPY,,ok,https://www.foster-electric.com | https://www.foster-electric.com/about/ | https://www.foster-electric.com/products/,"Foster Electric Company, Limited Company Info Company Info TOP Top Message Overview History of Foster Management Group Companies Close Products Products TOP Speakers / Buzzers Micro Speakers Buzzers Industrial Speakers General Speakers Headphones / Headsets Earphones Earphone Drivers OEM Inquiry Open new window Actuator Vibration Actuator VDA-09 (Product under development) 2 in 1 Vibration Speakers FOSTEX brand products Open new window Product Inquiry Open new window Close Investor Relations Investor Relations TOP IR News IR Library Medium Term Business Plan Financial Information Stock Information IR Calendar Disclosure Policy and Disclaimer Close Sustainability Sustainabil