8,6845,6845.T,6845.T,4,ok,EQUITY,Azbil Corporation,Industrials,Specialty Industrial Machinery,https://www.azbil.com,"Azbil Corporation provides automation products and services worldwide. It operates through three segments: Building Automation Business, Advanced Automation Business, Life Automation Business, and others. The Building Automation Business segment offers indoor temperature and humidity sensors, ceiling temperature sensors, indoor temperature and humidity controllers, infrared array sensors, workplace sensors, digital setting devices, marcellia-compatible user terminals, integrated user terminals, building automation systems, access control systems, contactless IC card readers, air conditioning equipment controllers, heat source equipment systems, air conditioning equipment, and control functions, etc.; and control valves, graphical controllers, digital mass flow controllers, instrumentation network modules, differential pressure transmitters, electromagnetic flow meters, and smart valves. The Advanced Automation Business segment offers positioners, collaborative automation systems, process controllers, adjustable proximity sensors, photoelectric switch, advanced UV sensor, limit switch, thermal micro liquid flow meter, dynamic monitoring system, online abnormality detection system, cloud services, ultrasonic gas meters, diaphragm smart meters, smart meter, and microcomputer meter. The Life Automation Business Segment offers pressure governor, battery-powered electromagnetic water meter, electronic water meter, air conditioning systems, whole-house air purification and ventilation systems, system, whole-building air purification and ventilation system, etc., and insurance agency software development services, etc. The company was formerly known as Yamatake Corporation and changed its name to Azbil Corporation in April 2012. Azbil Corporation was founded in 1906 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",738724478976,JPY,,ok,https://www.azbil.com,"Azbil Corpo