8,6849,6849.T,6849.T,2,ok,EQUITY,Nihon Kohden Corporation,Healthcare,Medical Devices,https://www.nihonkohden.com,"Nihon Kohden Corporation engages in research and development, production, sales, and repair and maintenance of medical electronic equipment in Japan, North America, Latin America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. It offers physiological measuring equipment, such as electroencephalographs, evoked potential and electromyogram measuring systems, electrocardiographs, polygraphs for Cath lab, diagnostic information systems, recording paper, electrodes, and EP catheters. The company also provides patient monitors, including central monitors, bedside monitors, wireless monitors, remote access software and other equipment, clinical information systems, and electrodes and sensors. In addition, it offers defibrillators, automated external defibrillators(AED), ventilators, pacemakers, anesthesia machines, automated chest compression devices, AED pads, batteries, and ablation catheters; hematology analyzers, clinical chemistry analyzers, ultrasound diagnostic equipment and others, consumables, including test reagents, and installation and maintenance services. Further, it is involved in technology licensing business. The company was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan.",242278203392,JPY,,ok,https://www.nihonkohden.com,"Nihon Kohden Global Site CLOSE MENU mv-slider lazy: true Global Top サブ-ナビゲーション Information Our Philosophy Our Technology Company Profile Investor Relations Sustainability Careers Product Security Portal Select Region Contact Us Privacy Policy Site Policy Social Media Policy Global Top Latest News Aug 06, 2026 Nihon Kohden adds FY2026 first quarter supplementary data Aug 06, 2026 Consolidated Financial Highlights presentation for the 1st Quarter of the Fiscal Year Ending March 31, 2027 （937KB） Aug 06, 2026 Consolidated Financial Results for the 1st Quarter of the Fiscal Year Ending March 31, 2027(Japan GAAP) （580KB） Jul 31, 2