Software Home Products Products Lineup Sensors KEYENCE Sensors are used to detect, measure, and inspect a target during a process to increase efficiency. Measurement Sensors Non-contact, high precision laser distance sensors, position sensors and measurement sensors. Measurement sensors are everywhere; they’re in the smartphone you’re holding and in the satellites orbiting our planet. Machine Vision Inspect, identify, and guide parts using our broad range of vision products. Process Controls / Process Sensors Monitor equipment processes including pressure and flow. Pneumatic Components KEYENCE has a large lineup of pneumatic devices, which enable flow rate monitoring and predictive maintenance, maximizing the added value of your devices. Safety Machine Safety plays a key role in every factory environment. KEYENCE offers a variety of safety products for any machine guarding application. Microscopes / Laser Microscopes Advanced microscopes for industrial and life science applications. Optical Metrology Systems Turnkey automated optical measurement systems. 3D Measurement Systems Off-line 3D measurement systems for various industries and applications. Controls Machine control products such as programmable logic controllers and HMIs. Marking / Coding Cut, etch and engrave barcodes, date codes, serial numbers and logos on a variety of surfaces. Barcode Readers An extensive range of fixed mount 1-D/2-D barcode readers and handheld scanners for industrial applications. Mobile Computers / Handheld Computers This product's incredibly wide reading range and speed lead to major improvements in work efficiency. It is equipped with functions that enable one-handed operation. Data Acquisition This system measures temperature, voltage, current, strain, acceleration, rotation, pressure, CAN, and more. It is also known as a DAQ. Static Control Explore static eliminators for industrial applications. Reduce static with electrostatic field sensors, static meters, and advanced elimination technology. RPA / Desktop Automation Software Navigation RPA records your computer operations and then performs them automatically. Additive Manufacturing 3D printers for exceptional precision and stability: for prototyping in development & additive manufacturing of jigs and fixtures. Browse by Industry Browse by Industry Product Categories Sensors Photoelectric Sensors Fiber Optic Sensors Laser Sensors Inductive Proximity Sensors Positioning Sensors Vision Sensors Network Communication Units Specific Solution Sensors Cylinder Sensors Measurement Sensors Laser Profiler / 3D Laser Snapshot Sensor Laser Displacement Sensors Optical Micrometer / Laser Micrometer Spectral Interference Displacement Sensor Inductive Displacement Sensors LVDT / Contact Displacement Sensors (Probes) Machine Vision Vision Systems Vision Sensors Process Controls / Process Sensors Flow Sensors / Flow Meters Pressure Sensors Temperature Sensors Level Sensors Pneumatic Components Cylinder Sensors Directional Control Valves / Cushion Valves Gas Flow Sensors Gas Pressure Sensors Safety Safety Light Curtains Safety Laser Scanners Safety Interlock Switches Safety Controller Microscopes / Laser Microscopes Digital Microscopes 3D Optical Profiling Microscope Fluorescence Microscopes Colony Counter Elemental Analyzer Optical Metrology Systems Optical Comparator (Profile Projector) 3D Measurement Systems CMM (Coordinate Measuring Machine) 3D Scanner 3D Optical Profilometers Controls PLC (Programmable Logic Controller) Micro PLC / Small PLC HMI Servo Motors / Servo Systems Other Controls Marking / Coding Industrial Laser Marking Systems / Laser Markers UV Laser Coder Continuous Inkjet Printers / Case Coder Barcode Readers Barcode Scanners Handheld Scanners Mobile Computers / Handheld Computers Mobile Computers / Handheld Computers Data Acquisition Data Acquisition (DAQ) Static Control Static Eliminators / Ionizers Electrostatic Sensors Additive Manufacturing 3D Printers RPA / Desktop Automation Softwa