8,6947,6947.T,6947.T,4,ok,EQUITY,Zuken Inc.,Technology,Software - Application,https://www.zuken.com,"Zuken Inc., a software company, research and development, manufacturing, and sales of solutions related to printed circuit board (PCB) designs, electrical panel and cabinet design, engineering data management, and wire harness designs in Japan, Europe, the United States, and rest of Asia. It offers CR-8000, an advanced PCB design software; E3.series, a design and manufacturing process for electrical and fluid planning, cable planning, and wire harness and cabinet layout; GENESYS, an integrated model-based systems engineering environment to define and manage system models; DS-2, a design data and workflow management; eCADSTAR, a PCB design for small and mid-sized teams; and CADSTAR, a desktop PCB design software. The company also provides training, implementation, design migration, and consulting services. The company was formerly known as Zukei Shori Gijutsu Kenkyusho Inc. and changed its name to Zuken Inc. in June 1985. Zuken Inc. was incorporated in 1976 and is headquartered in Yokohama, Japan.",103903477760,JPY,,ok,https://www.zuken.com | https://www.zuken.com/us/product/digital-engineering/model-based-engineering/ | https://www.zuken.com/us/product/digital-engineering/design-verification/,"PCB Design, Electrical/Wire Harness Design Software - Zuken Americas Skip to content Blog Events Webinars Community Support Login Americas Links to a regional Zuken site English Deutsch French Italian Americas Polish Japanese Chinese (Simplified) Korean Chinese (Traditional) Products Digital Engineering Digital Engineering Next Generation Design System Model Development Model Systems or Processes Model-Based Product Development Model-Based Engineering Model-Based Wire Harness Design E3.GENESYS Connector Design Verification Model and Product Consistency Connected Manufacturing Electrical and Electronic Design Digital Engineering eBook Digital Engineering eBook An exploration of 