ial Handling Mobility Ships & Ocean Aviation Space & Defense Technology 01 CARBON NEUTRAL WORLD 02 INNOVATION 03 MHI CORE TECHNOLOGIES 04 R&D CENTER, FACILITY 05 DIGITAL INNOVATION Intellectual Property Yokohama Hardtech Hub Technical Review Sustainability Topics Framework Material Issues GRI Guidelines Comparison Tables Materiality Explanation Cartoon TCFD Disclosure Declaration on Biodiversity How MHI Group is Helping to Protect Biodiversity Certification(ISO45001) Library Investors Management Policy Corporate Governance Disclosure Policy Financial Data Annual Performance Quarterly Performance IR Library Financial Results Medium-Term Business Plan Briefings by Topic MHI REPORT (Integrated Report) and Other Reports Conference Movie Stock and Bond Information Stock Information Shareholder Return Stock Quotes Shareholders' Meeting Corporate Ratings and Bonds Analyst Coverage The Articles of Incorporation Sustainable Finance IR Calendar FAQs IR INFORMATION DISCLAIMER IR Sitemap Insights STORIES CINEMA WHITEPAPERS Our online magazine Spectra brings you the stories behind the industrial innovations transforming our world. READ THE LATEST ARTICLES As Europe warms, cooling is in the spotlight 2026-08-31 ALL Products & Services Global News Hydrogen Ammonia Carbon Capture CCUS Data Center Carbon Neutral MISSION NET ZERO SDGs ALL SPECTRA NEWS Mitsubishi Heavy Industries and NEC to Form Strategic Allian... 2026-09-02 SPECTRA As Europe warms, cooling is in the spotlight 2026-08-31 NEWS MHIET Establishes Hydrogen Co-Firing Specifications for the ... 2026-08-27 NEWS New Model Added to Compact CO₂ Capture System ""CO₂MPACT™ Ful... 2026-08-26 SOLUTION Liquefied CO₂ (LCO₂) Carrier SPECTRA As Europe warms, cooling is in the spotlight 2026-08-31 SPECTRA Inside the Cambridge lab propelling turbomachinery into the ... 2026-08-27 SPECTRA Meet the robots making steelmaking safer and more efficient 2026-08-20 SPECTRA Why Europe is looking to geothermal for baseload energy 2026-08-18 SPECTRA How algorithmic design is changing industrial engineering 2026-08-06 NEWS 2026-09-03 [ Press ] [ Industrial Machinery ] 【Primetals Technologies, Ltd.】 Primetals Technologies and Inovance Strengthen Collaboration with Integrated PLTCM Drive Solutions 2026-09-02 Mitsubishi Heavy Industries, Ltd. [ Press ] [ Space & Defense ] Mitsubishi Heavy Industries and NEC to Form Strategic Alliance to Further Strengthen and Transform Defense Capabilities -- Collaboration in areas such as operation plans, command and control, and unmanned assets -- 2026-09-02 Mitsubishi Heavy Industries, Ltd. [ Press ] [ Aviation ] Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Initiates an Orderly Transition of MHICA Assets in Mississauga, Ontario to Bombardier 2026-08-27 Mitsubishi Heavy Industries, Ltd. [ Press ] [ Energy & Environment ] MHIET Establishes Hydrogen Co-Firing Specifications for the KU Series Gas Engine for Power Generation -- Commencing Proposal Activities for Hydrogen-Capable Solutions Supporting Energy Transition -- 2026-08-27 [ Press ] [ Industrial Machinery ] 【Primetals Technologies, Ltd.】 Primetals Technologies Strengthens Long-Term Partnership with JSW Steel Through Two Major Projects in India OUR BRAND Mitsubishi Heavy Industries (MHI) Group is one of the world’s leading industrial groups, spanning energy,logistics & infrastructure, industrial machinery, aerospace and defense. MHI Group combines cutting-edge technology with deep experience to deliver innovative, integrated solutions that help to realize a carbon neutral world, improve the quality of life and ensure a safer world. Outline of MHI Group OUR EXPERTISE FROM THE OCEAN TO OUTER SPACE EFFICIENT & CLEAN ENERGY As the leading supplier of power generation systems, MHI Group offers reliable and more sustainable power to people around the globe. We provide gas turbines that achieve the world’s highest level of thermal efficiency or more and have developed world-class boiler combustion technology. Furthermore, we utilize cutting-edge digital technology to minimize CO 2 emissions associated with power generation. SUPPORTING SAFE AND COMFORTABLE LIVING MHI Group’s passion is to enrich people’s lives. Whether through producing energy efficient and easy to clean home air conditioners or refrigeration units for trucks to deliver fresh foods around the world, or centrifugal chillers that support the large-scale air-conditioning required in buildings, hospitals, and event halls, we combine our technologies and our expertise to produce products to ensure that the end beneficiaries enjoy the ultimate experience. PROTECTING OUR ENVIRONMENT A pioneer in flue gas treatment technology, our Group has led the development of Japan’s environmental technologies for 40 years. The outstanding performance of our CO 2 capture technology is highly regarded and has been adopted globally, including the world’s largest CO 2 capture system for enhanced oil recovery in Texas. We maximize our engineering capabilities to protect our environment for future generations. SUPPORTING INDUSTRIES & LOGISTICS As a trusted supplier, MHI Group provides products and machinery to support a variety of industries. Utilizing our cutting-edge technologies, we deliver optimal machinery and systems solutions to our clients, such as offering unmanned laser-guided forklifts and automated storage facilities to manufacturing plants and warehouses, which are under pressure to optimize with the expansion of the e-commerce market. REIMAGINING TRANSPORTATION Leading the future of mobility is the unmanned AGT (Automated Guided Transit). MHI Group’s AGT is used by travelers around the world for transits within airports and as means of transport across cities. By providing a full-service system from manufacturing to operation and maintenance, we support people as they travel, every day MHI Group has developed more than 500 products and technologies over the years. By combining our technologies with our breadth of knowledge and experience, we deliver solutions to meet the needs of our partners. LEARN MORE ABOUT OUR BUSINESS SUSTAINABILITY We hope to realize a better future by solving society's most pressing issues with reliable manufacturing technology. MORE MHI Group Sustainability Material Issues SDG-Related Initiatives NOTICES 2026-05-08 Notification Regarding Fraudulent Investment Solicitations Impersonating Mitsubishi Heavy Industries and Its Executives 2026-05-01 Notification Regarding the Completion of Procedures for the Execution of a Contract to Take the Company's Consolidated Subsidiary Logisnext Co., Ltd. (Formerly Mitsubishi Logisnext Co., Ltd.) Private and the Transfer of a Consolidated Subsidiary 2026-03-13 Notice Concerning Capital Increase in Subsidiary and Change in Designation of Specified Subsidiary CAREERS Join us. Be a part of our team to MOVE THE WORLD FORWARD. MORE About Us Company Overview CEO Message Outline of MHI Group Business Area Global Network Locations Procurement REGIONS Our Business Key Solutions Products & Services Technology Sustainability Topics Library Investors Management Policy Financial Data IR Library Stock and Bond Information Insights STORIES CINEMA WHITEPAPERS Go to the top of this page This site (www.mhi.com) uses cookies in order to improve your experience and to provide content of your interest upon revisiting the site. For more information about the use of cookies on this site, please review our cookie policy in our Terms of Use. And please confirm that you agree to use of cookies by clicking Yes. Terms of Use Yes FOLLOW US : Footer SITE MAP TERMS OF USE PRIVACY POLICY CONTACT SPECTRA © MITSUBISHI HEAVY INDUSTRIES, LTD. ABOUT US | Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Skip to main content Header Menu NEWS CAREERS JP NEWS CAREERS JP NEWS CAREERS About Us About Us Company Overview Philosophy Corporate Policy Corporate Profile Officers Corporate Organization History Exhibition Facilities Event & Exhibition MHI Group’s Declaration to achieve Carbon Neutral by 2040 CEO Message Outli