8,7047,7047.T,ポート,8,ok,EQUITY,Port Inc.,Communication Services,Internet Content & Information,https://www.theport.jp,"Port Inc. operates various domain-specific vertical media and develops content marketing for user needs in Japan. The company provides Career Park, a career information platform for job hunting for students and adults; Career park! Employment agent that provides matching services between job hunters and companies; The Future of job hunting, an information site that provides job hunting know-how; cutlet, an event information site for job hunting students; and Job hunting meetings, a site that provides real word of mouth information for job hunting students. The company also operates Manet, an information site for borrowing, saving, and increasing money lives of users; Manet (card loan), a card information loan site; and Manet (FX), a site that provides information related to FX to users. In addition, it operates Card loan agent, an information site that provides know-how information on card loans; Energy Choice, a matching site for users and electric power companies to review electricity and gas bills; Moving procedure.com, an electricity and gas procedure support site for moving destinations; Port Medical, a medical care platform; and Telemedies BP, a medical care platform that provides online medical services for hypertension. The company was formerly known as Social Recruiting Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Port Inc. in March 2015. Port Inc. was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",28465735680,JPY,,ok,https://www.theport.jp | https://www.theport.jp/about | https://www.theport.jp/service,ポート株式会社（PORT INC.） 弊社を装った不審なサイトにご注意ください トップ Team PORT パーパス CEOメッセージ 企業情報 会社概要／役員紹介／アクセス 創業経緯／沿革 経営戦略 オフィス紹介 サービス ニュース IR IR‐En サステナビリティ 採用情報 M&A / 提携 お問い合わせ ACCESS パーパス CEOメッセージ 会社概要／役員紹介／アクセス 創業経緯／沿革 経営戦略 オフィス紹介 Solving Social Issues With TECHNOLOGY × REAL 100年後の次世代に社会的負債を引き継ぐのではなく、 自ら社会課題を特定し、提言から実行まで、 テクノロジー×リアルで推進する。 Scroll NEWS 2026.08