8,7245,7245.T,7245.T,6,ok,EQUITY,"Daido Metal Co., Ltd.",Consumer Cyclical,Auto Parts,https://www.daidometal.com,"Daido Metal Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of bearings in Japan, North America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company offers metal-polymer plain bearings used in various applications, including office and construction equipment, high-speed vehicles, trains, domed stadiums, and others, as well as hydro, thermal, and nuclear power plants. It also provides metallic bearings; engine bearings, such as half shell bearings, bushings, thrust washers, and turbocharger bearings for use in passenger cars, buses, ships, and building machinery; and turbomachinery bearing systems comprising turbine and supercharger bearings for propulsion steam turbines and large marine engines, power-generating turbine bearings, waterwheels for generator and water treatment pump bearings, and compressor and pump bearings. In addition, the company offers modular products consisting of small assembly products, insert molding products, and specialty-shaped products; RP-pumps and drum feeders; centralized lubrication products; and capacitors. It serves automotive, motorcycle, marine, construction machinery, agricultural machinery, industrial, energy, infrastructure and transportation, leisure, and household industries. Daido Metal Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1939 and is headquartered in Nagoya, Japan.",54422032384,JPY,,ok,https://www.daidometal.com | https://www.daidometal.com/products/ | https://www.daidometal.com/company/,"Daido Metal Sites - The Tribology Solution Search for: Markets Products Applications Investors Company Locations Distributors News Technology Sustainability Contact Us Company Locations Distributors News Technology Sustainability Contact Us Search for: Markets Products Applications Investors Automotive view more Automobile bearings are the cornerstone of Daido Metal's operations. Our products are proven performers in the high-technology engines of today, used in passenger cars, buses and race cars, including Formula 1 cars, providing an ultra-high-tech edge in motor sports applications. Marine view more Some types of large ship engines require large size bearings which are highly reliable, durable, and superior in heavy load capacity. Daido Metal is one of very few manufacturers in the world that manufactures extra-large-size bearings for low-speed 2-stroke diesel engines with a range of diameters over 1,000 mm. Wind Power view more Demand for offshore wind power generation is expected to increase in the future. We will improve ""bearing maintenance"" issues faced by generator manufacturers. DDK05 view more This product is an environmentally friendly ""Lead free bearing."" This compound bearing, a ""perfect oilless bearing"" that does not require any lubricant at all uses polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE) resin, has excellent low friction characteristics and also optimizes metal properties such as strength and dimensional stability. B B B B Date Category Notification 2026-09-01 IR 【NEW】 Notice Concerning the Status and Completion of Acquisition of Treasury Shares (204KB) 2026-08-07 IR FY2026 First Quarter Consolidated Financial Results (747KB) 2026-08-07 IR [Summary] Consolidated Financial Results for the Three Months Ended June 30, 2026 (290KB) 2026-08-03 IR Notice Concerning the Status of Acquisition of Own Shares (177KB) 2026-08-03 IR Expand Production Capacity at Its Mexican Production Base for Generator Engine Bearings Used in Data Centers（292KB) > See more Tackling the Challenge of Renewable Energy Wind Power Generation Hydroelectric Power Generation Bearings Agricultural Machines Automotive Construction Machinery Energy Household Industrial Infrastructure and Transportation Leisure Marine Motorcycle < > Choose A Market And Find Out More Powering Designs One Bearing at a Time Daido Metal has excelled in manufacturing durable, trusted bearings for products around the 