8,7266,7266.T,7266.T,5,ok,EQUITY,"Imasen Electric Industrial Co., Ltd.",Consumer Cyclical,Auto Parts,https://imasen.co.jp,"Imasen Electric Industrial Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and sells automotive parts in Japan and internationally. It also manufactures and sells industrial machinery parts, health equipment such as non-powered walking assistance devices, as well as other transportation machinery and equipment parts. The company offers power seat adjusters, rear combination lamp, light distribution test room, crash test device, automated machine line and guided vehicle, large press, and electromagnetic spiral horn products. In addition, it offers DC converter, power seat/seat heater control ECU, and backup power supply related products. Further, the company provides electric wheelchairs, prosthetic limbs, walking support machine, aircraft wire harness, and wire harness for machine tools. Additionally, the company develops, manufactures, and sells industrial cameras and image, video processing boards. The company manufactures and sells molds, jigs, and various machinery. Imasen Electric Industrial Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1939 and is headquartered in Inuyama, Japan.",21326280704,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://imasen.co.jp,
