8,7287,7287.T,7287.T,4,ok,EQUITY,"Nippon Seiki Co., Ltd.",Consumer Cyclical,Auto Parts,https://www.nippon-seiki.co.jp,"Nippon Seiki Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacturing and selling automotive, motorcycle, and general-purpose instruments, consumer electronics instruments, resin materials, and automobiles in Japan, the Americas, Europe, and the rest of Asia. It operates through four segments: Automotive Parts Business, Consumer Parts Business, Resin Compound Business, and Automobile Sales Segment. The company provides instrument cluster, head-up displays; level, revolution, angle, stroke, inertial, and ultrasonic velocity sensors; automotive EMS with high-density PCB mounting for automotive components; and aftermarket products, such as link meters and multi-digital displays under the Defi brand; and plastic optics design and manufacturing services. It also offers household appliances, including remote controllers for air conditioners, water heaters, and central controller equipment; office automation equipment comprising operation panels for multi-functional printers; and factory automation equipment for remote terminals. In addition, the company sells new and used automobiles; and provides car inspection and repair services, as well as offers car rental services. Further, it engages in the process and sale of resin materials; manufactures speedometers and engine tachometers, building and household control circuits, assembling harnesses for in-vehicle instruments, and fuel gauge sender units; provision of logistics, import/ export customs clearance, food, insurance agency, and advertising agency services; and information systems and services, and software and UI consulting business. Nippon Seiki Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1946 and is headquartered in Nagaoka, Japan.",155202535424,JPY,,ok,https://www.nippon-seiki.co.jp,"日本精機株式会社|NIPPON SEIKI 日本精機は、車載・民生ディスプレイ製品を始めとする電子機器・メカトロニクス製品の企画・設計・開発・製造・販売を行なっております。 JP | EN JP | EN 企業情報 事業内容 