8,7358,7358.T,7358.T,1,ok,EQUITY,Poppins Corporation,Consumer Cyclical,Personal Services,https://www.poppins.co.jp/english,"Poppins Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides family care and education care services in Japan. It operates through three segments: Family Care Business, Educare Business, and Professional Business. The company offers home care services for the children and elderly; household support; nanny and babysitting; lifestyle support and physical care services for the elderly comprising housekeeping, outing accompaniment, physical and senior care, consultation, and emergency services; and nursing care and consulting services. It also operates in-house daycare centers, after-school including licensed and unlicensed childcare facilities, and international schools; day service facilities for the elderly; nursery schools; children's centers; active learning schools; schools that provide guidance for kindergarten and elementary school entrance exams; and a portal site related to infertility prevention. In addition, the company offers domestic and overseas training programs; educational training, seminars, and e-learning; early childhood education and nanny training; research and development; survey; human resources dispatch and introduction; corporate training related to infertility prevention; and pet care services. Poppins Corporation was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",17720743936,JPY,,ok,https://www.poppins.co.jp/english | https://www.poppins.co.jp/english/about_poppins/ | https://www.poppins.co.jp/english/nanny/,"Poppins | Offering babysitter, childcare center, childcare support, and visiting elderly care service Poppins Contact ABOUT NANNY NURSERY SENIOR CARE CORPORATE TRAININGS Introduction About Poppins more History more Our Service Nanny Service Another Member of the Family, Watching Over the Growth of Your Child. more Nursery Service Providing the optimal enviroment for the essential stage of your child's development. more Poppins Hawaii Providing special Poppin's child care outside Japan, in Hawaii. more Senior Care Services Home Nursing-care Services for seniors, both home-nursing and mansion-style day service. more Service for Corporations and Municipalities Supporting a Balance between Child-rearing, Nursing-care and Work. more Domestic and Overseas Training A Human Resource Development System to Create the Future of the Childcare Field and Early Childhood Education. more ABOUT NANNY NURSERY Hawaii Keiki Waikiki SENIOR CARE CORPORATE TRAININGS Private Policy Poppins Compliance Contact Poppins Copyright © Poppins Corporation. All Rights Reserved. About Poppins | Poppins | Offering babysitter, childcare center, childcare support, and visiting elderly care service Poppins Contact ABOUT NANNY NURSERY SENIOR CARE CORPORATE TRAININGS About Poppins Message Corporate Profile Location History Related Activities Message We are a company that supports working women with EduCare and nursing services. Founded by my mother Noriko Nakamura, Poppins was born out of her pressing need to find trusted care for me as a child. The company’s forerunner, the Japan Association for Female Executives (JAFE), was established in 1985, followed by Poppins in 1987. Ever since, Poppins has continued to launch a wide range of services stemming from the challenges encountered in our own lives, including my own incomparable experience caring for my grandparents. Countless women continue to work for the future despite the emotional burden of being taken away from young children, sick family members, or household duties. Since the company’s founding, we have remained committed to our mission of supporting these working women. As well as being the first in Japan to train and arrange nannies (educational babysitters), Poppins is the country’s only provider of comprehensive services that cater to working women and new needs, from VIP care services for the elderly to licensed nursery schools, after school facilities, and international schools. We are entrusted with the precious lives of children and family members. Poppins not only looks after the children that will shape our future on the global stage, but offers added value to make their lives more radiant. With the utmost love and dedication, we also support those who worked hard to build the foundations for Japan today. That is our mission. More than 30 years after our company was established, working women are now the majority in Japan. At the same time, there also exists a deep-rooted unconscious bias that dictates who women should be, as mothers, wives, and individuals. We want to keep striving to eliminate these biases. At Poppins, we have always believed that our origin and growth engine is love. We will continue seeking to improve the quality of our services by sincerely listening to our customers' innermost concerns. When women flourish, society flourishes, and the world is transformed. At Poppins, the growth engine that drives this change is love. We will continue seeking to improve the quality of our services by sincerely listening to our customers' innermost concerns. Corporate Profile Poppins Group Philosophy Our firm shall strive to contribute to society through providing the highest standard of EduCare and elderly care services. Service Policy “To Be as One” — A service that listens to the voices of the customers’ hearts, and answers their needs with care. “To Act with Love” — A service full of love and respect, encompassing the customer with our kindness “To Be Reliable” — A service that is both trustworthy and irreplaceable. “To Never Compromise” — A service that is devoted to constant improvement Quality Policy To contribute to society through providing the highest standard of EduCare and elderly care services. 1. Strengthen human resource development 2. Provide an accident and injury-free service all year-around 3. Improve customer satisfaction Poppins Corporation Location Hiroo Plaza 5F 5-6-6 Hiroo Shibuya-ku Tokyo, 150-0012 Japan Established October, 2016 President and CEO Maiko Todoroki Main subsidiaries Poppins Corporation Poppins FamilyCare Inc. Poppins Professional Inc. Poppins Sitter Co., Ltd. Wish Inc. Hoikushi GO Inc. Poppins Educare Inc. Location Headquarter） Hiroo Plaza 5F 5-6-6 Hiroo Shibuya-ku Tokyo, 150-0012 Japan Osaka (Branch Office) SeiwaUmeda Building 10F 2-12-7 Sonezaki kita-ku Osaka-fu 530-0057, Japan Nagoya (Branch Office) Nagoyaekimaesakuradori Building 4F 3-26-8 Meieki Nakamura-ku Nagoya-shi 450-0002, Japan Description of Services ◆ Child-rearing Support Services Poppins Nursery School (Accredited Nurseries) Poppins Kids Room (Commercial Facilities, Hotel In-house Day-care Centers) Corporate In-house Nursery Facilities University In-house Nursery Facilities Hospital In-house Nursery Facilities Poppins EDU School (Test Preparation Classes for Kindergarten and Elementary School) Poppins International Preschool Poppins Active Learning School (School for Early Childhood Education) Poppins After School (After-school Classes) ◆Child-Rearing Business Consulting Support for Reconstruction, Management and Establishment of Nursery Facilities Temporary Placement of Child-Care Professionals Established March, 1987 Capital 96.57 million Yen President Atsushi Tamura Poppins FamilyCare Inc. Location Headquarter） Hiroo Plaza 5-6-6 Hiroo Shibuya-ku Tokyo, 150-0012 Japan Osaka (Branch Office) SeiwaUmeda Building 10F 2-12-7 Sonezaki kita-ku Osaka-fu 530-0057, Japan Nagoya (Branch Office) Nagoyaekimaesakuradori Building 4F 3-26-8 Meieki Nakamura-ku Nagoya-shi 450-0002, Japan Ashiya） 33-1 yamate-cho ashiya-shi 659-0096, Japan Poppins Service Kyoto） 8 Kinugasa-cho Kinugawa Kita-ku Kyoto-shi 603-8485 Japan Description of Services ◆ Child-rearing Support Services Poppins Nanny Services (Babysitting Educators) ◆Elderly Care Support Services Home Care Services for Seniors (Poppins VIP Care) Daytime Care Services Established July, 2021 Capital 90.00 million Yen